gametitle=Guitar Hero II (USA) (SLUS-21447) [CRC 2A6C845B]
comment=Experimental hold-to-hit v3. Restores normal button-press judgment and empty-press penalties. Requires a fresh game boot.

[Hold matching frets to hit notes (experimental v3)]
author=Codex - custom patch for Pablo
description=Hold matching frets for repeated notes. New presses retain normal hit/miss judgment, including empty-press penalties. Standard gamepad mode only. Requires a fresh game boot.
// USA retail 1.00 only; executable SHA-256 recorded in the accompanying notes.
// Uses EE RAM 000F0000 for the helper; do not combine with cheats using that area.
// Native release/sustain, scoring and missed-note routines are retained.
// New button presses generate their original strum; holding does not repeat strums.
